5️⃣ How to practice (VERY IMPORTANT)

Pick 3 incidents and prepare:

2–3 minutes per story

1 clear learning each

Numbers if possible (MTTR, latency, users)

Avoid:
❌ Tool dumping
❌ Blaming others
❌ “We didn’t know”
